        "notes": "Violence & Blood:\r\nFrequent combat encounters with mutants and hostile survivors.\r\nBlood effects (e.g., splatter when enemies are hit or defeated).\r\nSome environments feature disturbing imagery, such as blood-written messages on walls.\r\n\r\nPartial Nudity:\r\nSurvivors in the game may appear with minimal or tattered clothing, reflecting a harsh, post-apocalyptic setting. However, there is no explicit sexual content or depiction of sexual acts.\r\n\r\nHorror Elements:\r\nDark, tense bunker corridors and mutated enemies aim to create a tense and oppressive atmosphere.\r\nThemes of desperation and survival in a post-disaster world may be unsettling to some players.\r\n\r\nThemes & Story:\r\nThe overarching story includes references to war and conflict between social groups, but does not depict sexual violence, drug abuse, or explicit references to self-harm.\r\nPlayers should be aware that violence is a core part of gameplay and that some scenes may be intense or unsettling."
